🫦 Togetherly • v1.31.0

— Video messages in shapes: a heart, a star, a diamond and six more. Hold the button in chat, then let go — your hands stay free
— Open one full screen, drop a heart on the exact second, scrub with your finger, save it to your gallery
— The circle is free for everyone, the other shapes come with Togetherly+
— "Vessel of the month": a month of moods where every kind of entry gets its own floor, and the vessel can be shared to stories
— The year of moods is a grid now, empty weeks no longer take up space
— Drawings are editable: pick a shape with your finger, move it, rotate it, stretch it
— Togetherly+ can be bought right on iPhone
— Fixed: partner's birthday shifting by a day, mirrored selfies, location draining the battery, watching together
